 ## layout-templates · surface-console
+decision/console-agents-read-off-loop · Console agents read off the key loop — The terminal fleet console reads the claude agents list on its own thread at most once every 5 s, off its drawing and key loop, so a key never waits on it.
+decision/console-fleet-body-lines · Console fleet drawn as body lines — The terminal fleet console draws the fleet as body lines between its title line and its key line, the board's rows in the board's forest order and indent.
